lass=\"hp-btn hp-btn-ghost\" href=\"/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a></div><div class=\"hp-trust\"><span><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/identity-verification/\" style=\"color:inherit;font-size:inherit\">Every client ID-verified</a> — no exceptions</span><span class=\"hp-trust-sep\">·</span><span>Registered Tax Agent</span><span class=\"hp-trust-sep\">·</span><span>FCPA, CPA Australia</span></div></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Find your fee</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">What do you need?</h2><div class=\"sv-tiles\"><a class=\"sv-tile\" href=\"#start-a-business\"><span class=\"sv-tile-n\">01</span><span class=\"sv-tile-h\">Start a business</span><span class=\"sv-tile-p\">Company, ABN, GST, business name, trust, partnership and SMSF setup, plus bundles.</span><span class=\"sv-tile-go\">See setup fees</span></a><a class=\"sv-tile\" href=\"#run-your-business\"><span class=\"sv-tile-n\">02</span><span class=\"sv-tile-h\">Run your business</span><span class=\"sv-tile-p\">Bookkeeping from $199 a month, BAS $99 a quarter, ASIC compliance $99 a year.</span><span class=\"sv-tile-go\">See ongoing fees</span></a><a class=\"sv-tile\" href=\"#lodge-a-tax-return\"><span class=\"sv-tile-n\">03</span><span class=\"sv-tile-h\">Lodge a tax return</span><span class=\"sv-tile-p\">Individual returns from $99. Company, partnership, trust and SMSF returns, and super refunds.</span><span class=\"sv-tile-go\">See tax return fees</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-white\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><section class=\"sv-group\" id=\"start-a-business\"><div class=\"hp-sec-head\"><div><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Start a business</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Setup fees</h2></div><p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">One-off fixed fees. ASIC fees and stamp duty are added at cost, listed under government charges.</p></div><div class=\"pr-list\"><div class=\"pr-row pr-head\"><div>Service</div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Turnaround</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Fee, inc. GST</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/company-registration/\">Company setup</a></h4><p>A Pty Ltd registered with ASIC — name, ACN, constitution, shares and directors.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1 business day</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$299<span class=\"pr-plus\">+ $636 ASIC fee</span></div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/abn-application/\">ABN application</a></h4><p>An ABN for the right entity, or a straight answer that you don’t need one.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1–3 business days</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$99</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/gst-registration/\">GST registration</a></h4><p>Registered from the correct date, on the reporting cycle that suits you.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1–2 business days</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$69</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/abn-application/\">ABN and GST together</a></h4><p>Both registrations done in one pass.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1–3 business days</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$149</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/business-name-registration/\">Business name registration</a></h4><p>Checked for availability and trade mark clashes, then registered.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1 business day</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$79<span class=\"pr-plus\">+ $47 ASIC fee (1 year)</span></div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\">Trust setup — discretionary trust</a></h4><p>Deed, registrations and an individual trustee.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">2–3 business days</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$649<span class=\"pr-plus\">+ duty in NSW and Vic</span></div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\">Trust setup — unit trust</a></h4><p>Where the owners need fixed shares.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">2–3 business days</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Quoted first</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/partnership-setup/\">Partnership setup</a></h4><p>TFN, ABN and a written partnership agreement, so everyone knows their share.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">2–3 business days</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$449</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/smsf/\">SMSF setup — individual trustees</a></h4><p>A self-managed super fund established, registered and ready to take rollovers.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1–2 weeks</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$749</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/smsf/\">SMSF setup — corporate trustee</a></h4><p>As above, with a special purpose trustee company.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">1–2 weeks</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$1,349<span class=\"pr-plus\">+ $636 ASIC fee</span></div></div></div><div class=\"pr-subhead\"><h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Bundles</h3><p>Set up together, for less.</p></div><div class=\"hp-tiers sv-bundles\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><div class=\"hp-tier hp-tier-pick\"><div class=\"hp-tier-flag\">Most popular</div><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Start-up bundle</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$449</div><div class=\"sv-save\">Saves $78 · plus $683 ASIC fees</div><p>A new company ready to trade, registered in the right order.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Company setup</div><div>ABN and TFN</div><div>GST registration</div><div>Business name</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/start-up-bundle/\">Details</a></div></div><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Trust + corporate trustee</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$869</div><div class=\"sv-save\">Saves $79 · plus $636 ASIC fee and any duty</div><p>A family trust with a company as trustee, set up together.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Trustee company</div><div>Discretionary trust deed</div><div>Trust ABN and TFN</div><div>GST if it will trade</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/trust-corporate-trustee/\">Details</a></div></div><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">SMSF + first year</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\"><span style=\"font-size:0.45em;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;margin-right:0.3em\">from</span>$2,099</div><div class=\"sv-save\">Saves $248 · plus the ATO levy</div><p>Your super fund established and carried through year one.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Deed, ABN, TFN and ESA</div><div>Rollover help</div><div>First-year accounts</div><div>Audit and annual return</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/smsf-setup-first-year/\">Details</a></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><section class=\"sv-group\" id=\"run-your-business\"><div class=\"hp-sec-head\"><div><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Run your business</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Ongoing fees</h2></div><p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">Monthly, quarterly or yearly, and fixed, so you can budget for them.</p></div><div class=\"pr-subhead\"><h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Bookkeeping</h3><p>Priced by your annual turnover, with payroll added per employee. BAS lodgement is included in every tier.</p></div><div class=\"hp-tiers\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Turnover up to $250k</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$199<span class=\"pr-per\">/ month</span></div><p>Your bank and card accounts coded and reconciled every month, so your numbers are right when you need them.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Bank accounts reconciled monthly</div><div>Quarterly BAS prepared and lodged</div><div>Payroll + $15 per employee a month</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\">Details</a></div></div><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Turnover $250k – $1m</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$399<span class=\"pr-per\">/ month</span></div><p>Your bank and card accounts coded and reconciled every month, so your numbers are right when you need them.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Bank accounts reconciled monthly</div><div>Quarterly BAS prepared and lodged</div><div>Payroll + $15 per employee a month</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\">Details</a></div></div><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Turnover $1m – $3m</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$749<span class=\"pr-per\">/ month</span></div><p>Your bank and card accounts coded and reconciled every month, so your numbers are right when you need them.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Bank accounts reconciled monthly</div><div>Quarterly BAS prepared and lodged</div><div>Payroll + $15 per employee a month</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\">Details</a></div></div></div><p class=\"pr-note\">Payroll is $15 per employee a month on top of the tier, whatever the pay frequency — pay runs, payslips, super and Single Touch Payroll reporting. A business turning over $600k with four staff pays $399 + $60 = $459 a month. Over $3m turnover, we quote.</p><div class=\"pr-subhead\"><h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Lodgement and compliance</h3></div><div class=\"pr-list\"><div class=\"pr-row pr-head\"><div>Service</div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Turnaround</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Fee, inc. GST</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/bas-gst-lodgement/\">BAS &amp; GST lodgement</a></h4><p>Your BAS prepared from your books, checked and lodged before it is due. Included in every bookkeeping tier.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Before the due date</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$99<span class=\"pr-plus\">per quarter</span></div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/services/company-annual-compliance/\">Company annual compliance</a></h4><p>ASIC registered agent, annual review, registers, minutes and the solvency resolution.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Within the review window</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$99<span class=\"pr-plus\">per year + $342 ASIC fee</span></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-white\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><section class=\"sv-group\" id=\"lodge-a-tax-return\"><div class=\"hp-sec-head\"><div><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Lodge a tax return</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Tax return fees</h2></div><p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">Prepared, checked and lodged by a registered tax agent. Quoted before we start.</p></div><div class=\"pr-subhead\"><h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Individual returns</h3><p>Most people fit the first tier. If yours needs more, we tell you before we do the work.</p></div><div class=\"hp-tiers\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><div class=\"hp-tier hp-tier-pick\"><div class=\"hp-tier-flag\">Most people</div><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Individual return</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$99</div><p>Salary and wages, bank interest, the usual work-related deductions.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Prepared and checked by a registered tax agent</div><div>Deduction review against your occupation</div><div>Lodged electronically, usually within 2 business days</div><div>Fee can come out of your refund, for $44</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/individual-tax-return/\">Details</a></div></div><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Individual + investments</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$179</div><p>Adds shares, managed funds, crypto disposals or a rental property.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Everything in the individual return</div><div>Capital gains worked and documented</div><div>One rental property schedule</div><div>Depreciation schedule reviewed</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/individual-tax-return/\">Details</a></div></div><div class=\"hp-tier\"><div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Sole trader</div><div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$299</div><p>Business schedule, GST position and the next instalment worked out.</p><div class=\"hp-tier-list\"><div>Business income and expense schedule</div><div>Home office and vehicle apportionment</div><div>PAYG instalment estimate for next year</div><div>GST registration check</div></div><div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/individual-tax-return/\">Details</a></div></div></div><div class=\"pr-subhead\"><h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Individual add-ons</h3><p>Added to a base return where they apply, and quoted before we do the work.</p></div><div class=\"pr-list\"><div class=\"pr-row pr-head\"><div>Add-on</div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Fee, inc. GST</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Additional rental property</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$79</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Capital gains schedule</h4><p>Per asset parcel.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$59</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Crypto disposals</h4><p>Worked from an exchange export.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$99</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Prior year return</h4><p>Each year.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$99</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Amendment to a return we did not prepare</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$149</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Fee taken from your refund</h4><p>Optional — pay the fee up front and this does not apply.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$44</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/identity-verification/\">Identity verification</a></h4><p>Every client, every service — a three-minute electronic check before we start.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Included</div></div></div><div class=\"pr-subhead\"><h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Business, trust and super returns</h3><p>The fee depends on the size of the books, so it is a starting price and confirmed in your written quote.</p></div><div class=\"pr-list\"><div class=\"pr-row pr-head\"><div>Service</div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Turnaround</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Fee, inc. GST</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/company-tax-return/\">Company tax return</a></h4><p>Financial statements and the company return, prepared together.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Set with your quote</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">from $899</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/partnership-tax-return/\">Partnership tax return</a></h4><p>The partnership return and each partner’s distribution statement, lodged in one pass.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Set with your quote</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">from $549</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/trust-tax-return/\">Trust tax return</a></h4><p>Trust accounts, the 30 June distribution resolution and the trust return.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Set with your quote</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">from $749</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/smsf-tax-return/\">SMSF annual return</a></h4><p>Annual administration, accounts and the SMSF annual return.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Set with your quote</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">from $1,099<span class=\"pr-plus\">+ $499 audit</span></div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/smsf-tax-return/\">SMSF independent audit</a></h4><p>Arranged for you and done by a separate SMSF auditor, as the law requires.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Set with your quote</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$499</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/superannuation-refund/\">Super refund</a></h4><p>Claim your super back after leaving Australia (DASP), or track down lost super if you’re staying.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\">Set with your quote</div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Quoted first</div></div></div></section></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><section id=\"government-charges\"><div class=\"hp-sec-head\"><div><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Government charges</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Passed on at cost</h2></div><p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">We do not mark these up. ASIC, the ATO and state revenue offices set them, and ASIC indexes its fees every 1 July. Amounts shown apply from 1 July 2026.</p></div><div class=\"pr-list\"><div class=\"pr-row pr-head\"><div>Charge</div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">Amount</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ASIC — register a proprietary company</h4><p>Also the fee for an SMSF trustee company.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$636</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ASIC — business name, 1 year</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$47</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ASIC — business name, 3 years</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$108</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ASIC — annual review, proprietary company</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$342</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ASIC — annual review, special purpose company</h4><p>The SMSF trustee company rate.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$70</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ATO — SMSF supervisory levy</h4><p>Charged at $518 in a fund’s first year.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$259</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">Trust deed stamp duty</h4><p>NSW and Victoria charge duty on a new deed; Queensland, WA, SA and the ACT do not.</p></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">at cost</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">ABN application at the Australian Business Register</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$0</div></div><div class=\"pr-row\"><div class=\"pr-svc\"><h4 class=\"pr-name\">GST registration with the ATO</h4></div><div class=\"pr-turn\"></div><div class=\"pr-fee\">$0</div></div></div><p class=\"pr-note\">The last two are free, and we would rather say so here than let you find out afterwards. What our fee buys is the decision underneath the form — whether you need an ABN at all, whether registering for GST early costs you money, whether a company or a trust helps you or just adds a return you now have to lodge. If you only want the form typed in, do it yourself at <a href=\"https://www.abr.gov.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">abr.gov.au</a> and keep the money.</p></section></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-white\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Why a registered agent</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">What the fee actually buys</h2><div class=\"sv-fees\"><div><h3>Checked against the ATO</h3><p>We reconcile your return against the data the ATO already holds, so what you lodge and what they expect agree.</p></div><div><h3>Judgement on the grey areas</h3><p>Apportionment, what counts as a repair, whether a course is deductible. We sign the return, and the practice carries professional indemnity for the position taken.</p></div><div><h3>Bound by the Code</h3><p>We are registered with the Tax Practitioners Board as a Registered Tax Agent. Our <a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/legal/tpb/\">tax agent obligations</a> page sets out what that means and how to complain.</p></div></div><p class=\"pr-note\">If your return is one job, no investments and no deductions worth arguing about, myTax is free and perfectly adequate. We would rather say that than take $99 for typing in numbers the ATO already had.</p></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\"><div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\"><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">FAQs</p><h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Questions people actually ask</h2><div class=\"sv-faq\"><details><summary>Is the fee deductible?</summary><p>Yes. The cost of managing your tax affairs is deductible in the year you pay it, so this year’s fee is claimed on next year’s return. At the 30% bracket a $99 fee costs you about $67 after tax.</p></details><details><summary>Can the fee come out of my refund?</summary><p>Yes, for individual returns, and it costs $44. The ATO pays the refund to our trust account, we deduct the fee and forward the balance to you, usually within one business day of the refund landing. It is optional — pay the fee up front and the $44 does not apply.</p></details><details><summary>What if my work turns out to be more complicated?</summary><p>We tell you before we do the work, not after. If what you send us needs a higher tier or an add-on, you get a revised quote and you decide. We do not invoice a surprise.</p></details><details><summary>Are government fees included?</summary><p>No. ASIC fees, stamp duty and the ATO’s SMSF levy are shown separately and passed on at cost, without markup. Everything else on this page includes GST.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a charge for the identity check?</summary><p>No. Every client completes a three-minute electronic identity check before any work starts — a licence or passport, a selfie, and a match against government records — and it is built into every fee on this page. There is no verification surcharge for individuals, and no per-director charge for companies and trusts. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How the check works</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Do you charge for the calculators?</summary><p>No, and we never will. They are free, ungated and unlimited. We charge for preparing and lodging, which is the part that needs a registered agent.</p></details><details><summary>What if I owe money instead of getting a refund?</summary><p>The fee is the same — the work is the same. If you are facing a bill, an agent is usually worth more rather than less, because the deductions we find come straight off it.</p></details></div></div></div><div class=\"hp-band hp-startcta\"><div class=\"hp-shell\"><div class=\"hp-startcta-grid\"><div><p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Ready when you are</p><h2 class=\"hp-startcta-h\">Start online today, or get a fixed-fee quote first.</h2><p class=\"hp-startcta-p\">Nothing is charged until you approve the finished work. Need something not listed here? We’ll quote it in writing, usually within one business day.</p></div><div class=\"hp-startcta-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start my return</a><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-ghost\" href=\"/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/pricing/#faq\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/pricing/\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the fee deductible?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The cost of managing your tax affairs is deductible in the year you pay it, so this year’s fee is claimed on next year’s return. At the 30% bracket a $99 fee costs you about $67 after tax.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can the fee come out of my refund?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, for individual returns, and it costs $44. The ATO pays the refund to our trust account, we deduct the fee and forward the balance to you, usually within one business day of the refund landing. It is optional — pay the fee up front and the $44 does not apply.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if my work turns out to be more complicated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We tell you before we do the work, not after. If what you send us needs a higher tier or an add-on, you get a revised quote and you decide. We do not invoice a surprise.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are government fees included?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. ASIC fees, stamp duty and the ATO’s SMSF levy are shown separately and passed on at cost, without markup. Everything else on this page includes GST.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there a charge for the identity check?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Every client completes a three-minute electronic identity check before any work starts — a licence or passport, a selfie, and a match against government records — and it is built into every fee on this page. There is no verification surcharge for individuals, and no per-director charge for companies and trusts. How the check works .\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you charge for the calculators?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, and we never will. They are free, ungated and unlimited. We charge for preparing and lodging, which is the part that needs a registered agent.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if I owe money instead of getting a refund?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The fee is the same — the work is the same. If you are facing a bill, an agent is usually worth more rather than less, because the deductions we find come straight off it.\"}}]}</script></div>\n"
